Relevant columns and potential usage  
• DICOM_PIVOT."collection_id": restrict data set to the “qin_prostate_repeatability” collection.  
• DICOM_PIVOT."SeriesDescription": locate desired image‑series types (DWI, T2 Weighted Axial, Apparent Diffusion Coefficient).  
• DICOM_PIVOT."Modality": confirm image vs segmentation objects (e.g., “SEG”).  
• DICOM_PIVOT."SeriesInstanceUID": join key to SEGMENTATIONS."segmented_SeriesInstanceUID".  
• DICOM_PIVOT."StudyInstanceUID": value we ultimately need to count (unique studies).  
• SEGMENTATIONS."segmented_SeriesInstanceUID": links a segmentation object to its source image series.  
• SEGMENTATIONS."SeriesInstanceUID": UID of the segmentation series itself (may be useful for inspection).  
• SEGMENTATIONS."StudyInstanceUID": study identifier available inside the segmentation table.

Typical conditions  
• DICOM_PIVOT."collection_id" = 'qin_prostate_repeatability'  
• DWI images: DICOM_PIVOT."SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%DWI%'  
• T2 Weighted Axial images: DICOM_PIVOT."SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%T2%' AND "SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%AX%'  
• Apparent Diffusion Coefficient images: DICOM_PIVOT."SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%Apparent%Diffusion%Coefficient%' OR ILIKE '%ADC%'  
• T2 Weighted Axial segmentations:  
  – SEGMENTATIONS."segmented_SeriesInstanceUID" = DICOM_PIVOT."SeriesInstanceUID"  
  – DICOM_PIVOT."SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%T2%' AND ILIKE '%AX%'  
  – DICOM_PIVOT."collection_id" = 'qin_prostate_repeatability'  

Below are ten exploratory Snowflake SQL queries (simple → complex) that examine the above columns and culminate in the final answer query.  
All identifiers are wrapped in double quotes, and each query contains a brief description comment.

```sql
-- 1. List a sample of series descriptions in the qin_prostate_repeatability collection
SELECT DISTINCT "SeriesDescription"
FROM "IDC"."IDC_V17"."DICOM_PIVOT"
WHERE "collection_id" = 'qin_prostate_repeatability'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2. Inspect DWI‑type series descriptions
SELECT DISTINCT "SeriesDescription"
FROM "IDC"."IDC_V17"."DICOM_PIVOT"
WHERE "collection_id" = 'qin_prostate_repeatability'
  AND "SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%DWI%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3. Inspect T2 Weighted Axial series descriptions
SELECT DISTINCT "SeriesDescription"
FROM "IDC"."IDC_V17"."DICOM_PIVOT"
WHERE "collection_id" = 'qin_prostate_repeatability'
  AND "SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%T2%' 
  AND "SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%AX%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4. Inspect Apparent Diffusion Coefficient series descriptions (ADC)
SELECT DISTINCT "SeriesDescription"
FROM "IDC"."IDC_V17"."DICOM_PIVOT"
WHERE "collection_id" = 'qin_prostate_repeatability'
  AND (
        "SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%Apparent%Diffusion%Coefficient%' 
        OR "SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%ADC%'
      )
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5. Distinct StudyInstanceUIDs for DWI series
SELECT DISTINCT "StudyInstanceUID"
FROM "IDC"."IDC_V17"."DICOM_PIVOT"
WHERE "collection_id" = 'qin_prostate_repeatability'
  AND "SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%DWI%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6. Distinct StudyInstanceUIDs for T2 Weighted Axial series
SELECT DISTINCT "StudyInstanceUID"
FROM "IDC"."IDC_V17"."DICOM_PIVOT"
WHERE "collection_id" = 'qin_prostate_repeatability'
  AND "SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%T2%'
  AND "SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%AX%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7. Distinct StudyInstanceUIDs for Apparent Diffusion Coefficient (ADC) series
SELECT DISTINCT "StudyInstanceUID"
FROM "IDC"."IDC_V17"."DICOM_PIVOT"
WHERE "collection_id" = 'qin_prostate_repeatability'
  AND (
        "SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%Apparent%Diffusion%Coefficient%' 
        OR "SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%ADC%'
      )
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8. Preview mapping of T2 Weighted Axial source images to their segmentation objects
SELECT 
       seg."SeriesInstanceUID"  AS "SEG_SERIES_UID",
       seg."segmented_SeriesInstanceUID" AS "SOURCE_SERIES_UID",
       img."SeriesDescription",
       img."StudyInstanceUID"
FROM   "IDC"."IDC_V17"."SEGMENTATIONS" seg
JOIN   "IDC"."IDC_V17"."DICOM_PIVOT"  img
       ON seg."segmented_SeriesInstanceUID" = img."SeriesInstanceUID"
WHERE  img."collection_id" = 'qin_prostate_repeatability'
  AND  img."SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%T2%'
  AND  img."SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%AX%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9. Distinct StudyInstanceUIDs coming from T2 Weighted Axial segmentations
SELECT DISTINCT img."StudyInstanceUID"
FROM   "IDC"."IDC_V17"."SEGMENTATIONS" seg
JOIN   "IDC"."IDC_V17"."DICOM_PIVOT"  img
       ON seg."segmented_SeriesInstanceUID" = img."SeriesInstanceUID"
WHERE  img."collection_id" = 'qin_prostate_repeatability'
  AND  img."SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%T2%'
  AND  img."SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%AX%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 10. Final query: count unique StudyInstanceUIDs across
--     DWI, T2 Weighted Axial, ADC, and T2 Weighted Axial segmentations
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT "StudyInstanceUID") AS "unique_study_count"
FROM (
      -- DWI
      SELECT DISTINCT "StudyInstanceUID"
      FROM "IDC"."IDC_V17"."DICOM_PIVOT"
      WHERE "collection_id" = 'qin_prostate_repeatability'
        AND "SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%DWI%'

      UNION

      -- T2 Weighted Axial
      SELECT DISTINCT "StudyInstanceUID"
      FROM "IDC"."IDC_V17"."DICOM_PIVOT"
      WHERE "collection_id" = 'qin_prostate_repeatability'
        AND "SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%T2%'
        AND "SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%AX%'

      UNION

      -- Apparent Diffusion Coefficient
      SELECT DISTINCT "StudyInstanceUID"
      FROM "IDC"."IDC_V17"."DICOM_PIVOT"
      WHERE "collection_id" = 'qin_prostate_repeatability'
        AND (
              "SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%Apparent%Diffusion%Coefficient%' 
              OR "SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%ADC%'
            )

      UNION

      -- T2 Weighted Axial segmentations
      SELECT DISTINCT img."StudyInstanceUID"
      FROM   "IDC"."IDC_V17"."SEGMENTATIONS" seg
      JOIN   "IDC"."IDC_V17"."DICOM_PIVOT"  img
             ON seg."segmented_SeriesInstanceUID" = img."SeriesInstanceUID"
      WHERE  img."collection_id" = 'qin_prostate_repeatability'
        AND  img."SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%T2%'
        AND  img."SeriesDescription" ILIKE '%AX%'
) AS all_studies;
```

